{
  "_comment": [
    "qits-1849: the payload fields of the events a declared wait is checked against (EventPayloadCatalog).",
    "A field is \"scalar\", an object {field: …}, a list of scalars [\"scalar\"] or a list of objects [{field: …}].",
    "eventId and occurredAt ride the envelope and are never payload fields; a null field is dropped from a",
    "payload, so every field here is optional on the wire. Keys starting with '_' are comments.",
    "The qits-workspaces entries are pinned by EventPayloadCatalogDriftTest against workspaces-events' records.",
    "The qits-ci entries (BuildStatusChanged, BuildSuccessful, BuildFailed, SoftwareRelease; ci-events) and the",
    "qits-projects entries (ReleaseRequestStateChanged, EntityTransitioned, EntityCommented, BranchDeliveryChanged,",
    "SCMRelease; service's bus package) are TRANSCRIBED BY HAND from those records on 2026-11-04 and are not",
    "pinned by any test, unlike qits-maintenance's ForeignEventContractTest: a field renamed there makes this",
    "door refuse a wait on the new name until it is transcribed here. An event named nowhere here is not checked."
  ],
